Migration Market AI Prompt

I want to create a marketplace for MIGRATION of open source Odoo apps. If this will be a success, I want to extend the marketplace for MAINTENANCE of open source Odoo apps.

SOURCES
1) github.com/odoo/odoo Odoo does maintenance, but data migration is needed for clients not subscribing to Odoo Enterprise. Migration is done on github.com/OCA/openupgrade.
2) github.com/OCA Community apps need migration to new versions, and maintenance.
3) Other open source Odoo apps also need migration to new versions, and maintenance.

DEFINITIONS
Migration: Making a [MIG] PR and follow up the PR until it is merged.
Maintenance: Making and follow up [FIX] PRs.
Client: Customer with Odoo database.
Partner: Doing Odoo services for clients, e.g. support, maintenance, development.
App: Module for Odoo, record in ir.module.module.

IMPLEMENTATION
Create an app to install on a central Odoo database to manage the marketplace.
Use existing apps (from Camptocamp and Onestein) to clone/monitor github apps & activity.

Create an app to install on each client database to sync info with the marketplace.

