STEP 1C: SOLVER
Read
- Solver settings
- Client: apps & willingness to pay
- Partner: capacity, price offer & time per app
Compute price offer fields
- score = f(price offer, solver settings)
- score_difference from the next price offer score
- score_status (disabled, considered, preferred, promised)
Do
- Solver 1: match client wtp & price offers
- Check partner capacity, disable price offers (consider the score difference with the next best offer) 
- Solver 2: match client wtp & price offers
- Check partner capacity
- Solver 3 if needed, loop until capacity is ok.
- Deal with offers with the exact same score (if needed, select the price offer with oldest modify).
Solver input
- Per app: cost
- Per client: apps & willingness to pay
Solver goal: max client value

